pendently corroborate the boot-ID transition. The only notable deficiency is uncleaned temporary evidence residue.","limitations":["OpenRC service-failure state was not captured because the generic lifecycle service probe only supported systemd; this does not undermine the directly tested standalone reader behavior.","The package-health snapshots do not enumerate every installed package, though native apk installation output and post-restart runtime checks directly establish the required compatible Python installation."]}
